{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject invalid exporter configuration at build time**\n\nA null or blank bucket is accepted and fails only during export, where the plugin catches the failure and emits nothing; a non-positive size limit also disables truncation. Validate required destinations and explicit positive limits before constructing clients, apply equivalent checks to the CloudWatch and Lambda log exporters, and add invalid-configuration tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0a5_","finding_digest":"e8a5b44aec088cacad74b5c8f27217af254f94633bd01809b417ffe58546b79c","finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"f91a70fa65de122c7ab9fa36918f25a8b1cdc8357c84fb22c69c1c240855a2de","observation_id":"aro_v1_7enhb6tf3yjcy6vz7i3jddzfvc","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/S3Exporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:04Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":135,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_vaeox7opcoyuj34beqabia4s3z","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:04Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
